### 주문 - 생성 성공
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 2,
  "productId": 2,
  "quantity": 1
}

> {%
if (response.body && response.body.data && response.body.data.id) {
  client.global.set("createdOrderId", String(response.body.data.id));
}
%}

### 주문 - 생성 실패: 재고 부족
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "productId": 4,
  "quantity": 999
}

